          <Pad Id="fIdqmY17U1Rufrfs2n0ByD" Bounds="85,814,830,94" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Notes:&#xD;&#xA;- Size is width and height in units (1 unit = 100 DIP). A Rectangle with width or height 0 is not drawn.&#xD;&#xA;- Position, rotation and scale come only from Transform. The Anchor is the point of the rectangle that sits at the origin and the pivot of Transform: TopLeft (orange) puts the top left corner on the Translation, Center (default, blue) centers the rectangle on it.&#xD;&#xA;- Connect it to Renderer [Qt] or a Group [Qt].">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="CoreLibBasics.vl">
